<title>USA: ShowBiz prices offering, to shuffle board.</title>
<headline>ShowBiz prices offering, to shuffle board.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ShowBiz Pizza Time Inc said Friday it would sell 3.2 million shares of its common stock in a public offering at $16.50 per share.</p>
<p>As announced previously, all of the shares are being sold by Hallwood Group Inc and its affiliates. ShowBiz will not receive any of the proceeds.</p>
<p>Showbiz quoted Hallwood as saying it had elected to sell substantially all of its ShowBiz shares in this offering in order to repay debt and focus on other investments.</p>
<p>After the closing, five members of ShowBiz's board affiliated with Hallwood are expected to resign, and the remaining four will elect new directors.</p>
<p>ShowBiz said the number of directors on the board will shrink to seven from nine.</p>
</text>
